All net profits go to [Lands Edge](https://www.landsedge.com.au/), a not-for-profit getting kids off screens and out in nature.

## When anyone can make anything, how do you decide what’s worth making?

Vijay Solanki, author, speaker, former CMO and founder coach asks: when anyone can make anything, how do you decide what’s worth making? In this lightning talk, he set out a perspective on how the most entrepreneurial marketers and founders use AI as a rapid prototyping tool to find product market fit, and how a focus on product, positioning, and placement is still essential in the AI era

## Behind the work: Ubank’s Money Done Better campaign

Director Simon Robson takes us behind the scenes of the AI production process for Ubank’s Money Done Better campaign, from live action to polished finish.

## The 2027 prediction engine

2026 had highs, lows and a bewildering number of in-betweens - and 2027 promises to be just as intense.

This interactive game asks our audience to predict the next 12 months.

